46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/09/8646177/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会は、Zりんのファンの皆様は笑顔が素敵な方が多くて優しいなと思いました。\nお世話になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/09/8646177/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてまあやの生誕Tシャツとかタオル！キーホルダーとかを身につけてくれたり、会いに来てくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/09/8646177/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざGWに来てくれてありがとっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/09/8646177/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しかったみんなの顔見て安心しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来れなかった方！\n気持ち届いてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/09/8646177/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/09/8646177/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/09/8646177/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/09/8646177/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛気づいた！？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2017/05/09/8646177/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/bl